messages.content:
{
  "summary": "Your phone is locked to 2G-only mode with poor signal. MMS requires at least 3G (ideally 4G/5G). We’ll switch your network mode to allow 4G/5G, then retest.",
  "thought_process": "Because calls/SMS work and APN/MMSC is present, the main blocker is the 2G-only network mode. MMS won’t work on 2G. Enabling 4G/5G should restore data speed sufficient for MMS. If needed, we’ll refresh the radio (airplane mode) and retest. If MMS still fails with good 4G/5G data, we’ll consider APN reset + reboot.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "step": "Allow 4G/5G networks",
      "instructions": [
        "On your phone, change the network mode to 4g_5g_preferred (or LTE/5G Auto).",
        "If you see options like 5G/4G/3G/2G (Auto), pick that.",
        "If there’s an LTE/4G only option and 5G isn’t available, LTE/4G only is fine too."
      ],
      "tool_equivalent": "set_network_mode_preference(mode=\"4g_5g_preferred\")"
    },
    {
      "step": "Refresh the radio (if needed)",
      "instructions": [
        "If it doesn’t switch off 2G within ~30 seconds, toggle Airplane Mode ON for 10 seconds, then OFF."
      ],
      "tool_equivalent": "toggle_airplane_mode()"
    },
    {
      "step": "Verify connection and retest",
      "instructions": [
        "Confirm the status bar now shows 4G/LTE or 5G with at least fair signal.",
        "Run run_speed_test and share the result.",
        "Try sending an MMS to yourself or a contact and tell me if it sends.",
        "If it still fails, run can_send_mms and share the output."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fallback_plan": [
    {
      "condition": "If you are still stuck on 2G after changing the mode and toggling Airplane Mode",
      "next": [
        "Set network mode to 4g_only (if available) to force reconnection, wait 30 seconds, then test again."
      ],
      "tool_equivalent": "set_network_mode_preference(mode=\"4g_only\")"
    },
    {
      "condition": "If you do get 4G/5G and data speed is fair/good but MMS still fails",
      "next": [
        "Reset APN settings to default, then reboot the phone and test MMS again."
      ],
      "tool_equivalent": [
        "reset_apn_settings()",
        "reboot_device()"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "questions": [
    "After changing the network mode, what network type do you see now (4G/LTE/5G) and what’s the speed test result?",
    "Did the MMS send successfully after the change?",
    "If not, what does can_send_mms report now?"
  ]
}

