        "After that completes, run reboot_device to restart the phone.",
        "When it comes back up, keep Wi‑Fi OFF and make sure Mobile Data is ON."
      ],
      "tool_equivalent": [
        "reset_apn_settings()",
        "reboot_device()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Retest MMS on mobile data",
      "instructions": [
        "Wait ~60 seconds after the reboot for the network to fully register.",
        "Confirm you still see 4G/5G with at least fair signal.",
        "Try sending an MMS to yourself or a contact.",
        "Also run can_send_mms and tell me what it reports."
      ]
    }
