messages.content:
{
  "message": "Great—since service and mobile data are now working but MMS still fails, the next most common causes are APN/MMSC settings, Wi‑Fi Calling interference, VPN, Data Saver, or missing messaging app permissions. Let’s check and fix these in order.",
  "thought_process": "MMS specifically requires a valid MMSC URL in the APN, and some phone features (Wi‑Fi Calling, VPN, Data Saver) or app permission gaps can block MMS even when data is fine. We’ll verify each and apply the appropriate fix.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Verify APN/MMSC",
      "why": "A missing/incorrect MMSC URL is the top reason MMS won’t send.",
      "do": [
        "Run check_apn_settings on your phone.",
        "Look for the MMSC URL field.",
        "If the MMSC is missing/blank or flagged incorrect: run reset_apn_settings to restore defaults, then run reboot_device to restart your phone.",
        "After reboot, try sending an MMS again (keep Wi‑Fi OFF for this test)."
      ],
      "tell_me": "Is an MMSC URL present? If you reset APN and rebooted, did MMS send afterward?"
    },
    {
      "title": "Temporarily turn OFF Wi‑Fi Calling",
      "why": "In some configurations, Wi‑Fi Calling can interfere with MMS.",
      "do": [
        "Run check_wifi_calling_status.",
        "If it’s ON, run toggle_wifi_calling to turn it OFF.",
        "With Wi‑Fi still OFF, try sending an MMS again."
      ],
      "tell_me": "Was Wi‑Fi Calling ON, and did turning it OFF help?"
    },
    {
      "title": "Rule out VPN",
      "why": "VPNs can block or misroute MMS traffic.",
      "do": [
        "Run check_vpn_status.",
        "If connected, run disconnect_vpn.",
        "Test sending an MMS again."
      ],
      "tell_me": "Was a VPN active, and did disconnecting it help?"
    },
    {
      "title": "Turn OFF Data Saver",
      "why": "Data Saver can restrict background traffic MMS relies on.",
      "do": [
        "Run check_data_restriction_status.",
        "If Data Saver is ON, run toggle_data_saver_mode to turn it OFF.",
        "Test MMS again."
      ],
      "tell_me": "Was Data Saver ON, and did turning it OFF help?"
    },
    {
      "title": "Confirm messaging app permissions",
      "why": "The app needs storage and SMS permissions to handle MMS.",
      "do": [
        "Run check_app_permissions with app_name=\"messaging\".",
        "If storage or sms permissions are missing, run grant_app_permission for \"storage\" and for \"sms\".",
        "Test MMS again."
      ],
      "tell_me": "Were any permissions missing, and did granting them fix it?"
    },
    {
      "title": "Optional quick capability check",
      "why": "To confirm the app reports MMS capability after fixes.",
      "do": [
        "Run can_send_mms.",
        "If it reports issues, share the exact result."
      ],
      "tell_me": "What does can_send_mms report?"
    }
  ],
  "next": "Please start with Step 1 (APN/MMSC) and let me know what you see. If MMS still fails after the APN reset and reboot, proceed to Steps 2–5 and report back after each step so I can adjust our troubleshooting."
}

