{
  "summary": "Your line is active, roaming is enabled on our side, and you now have 2 GB refueled. Since MMS still fails while abroad, the most common causes are device-side settings: data roaming off on the phone, unsuitable network mode (2G), Wi‑Fi Calling interference, missing MMSC (APN), VPN, or Data Saver.",
  "what_we_will_do": "Let’s run quick on-device checks in order and try sending an MMS after each change. Please share the results of each step so I can decide the next action.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Confirm device data/roaming and network type",
      "why": "MMS needs mobile data and at least 3G/4G. While your line is roaming-enabled, your phone’s own Data Roaming switch must also be ON.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_network_status and share the results (mobile data enabled, data roaming enabled, signal strength, and network type).",
        "If Mobile Data is OFF, use toggle_data to turn it ON.",
        "If Data Roaming is OFF, use toggle_roaming to turn it ON.",
        "If network type shows 2G/EDGE, use set_network_mode_preference with mode: \"4g_5g_preferred\".",
        "Run run_speed_test and tell me the result (no connection/very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent).",
        "Try sending an MMS again and tell me what happens."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Temporarily disable Wi‑Fi Calling",
      "why": "Some networks don’t support MMS over Wi‑Fi Calling while roaming.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_wifi_calling_status.",
        "If it’s ON, use toggle_wifi_calling to turn it OFF.",
        "Try sending an MMS again and report the result."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Verify APN/MMSC settings",
      "why": "An incorrect or missing MMSC URL will block MMS.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_apn_settings and tell me the APN name and whether an MMSC URL is shown.",
        "If MMSC is missing/looks wrong or you’re unsure, use reset_apn_settings.",
        "After resetting APN, use reboot_device to restart the phone.",
        "When it’s back on, try sending an MMS again and report the result."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Eliminate restrictions",
      "why": "VPNs and Data Saver can interfere with MMS delivery.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_vpn_status. If a VPN is connected, use disconnect_vpn.",
        "Run check_data_restriction_status. If Data Saver is ON, use toggle_data_saver_mode to turn it OFF.",
        "Try sending an MMS again and report the result."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Confirm messaging app permissions",
      "why": "MMS needs storage and SMS permissions to attach/send media.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_app_permissions with app_name: \"messaging\" and tell me what’s granted.",
        "If storage or sms permissions are missing, use grant_app_permission for each missing one (\"storage\" and/or \"sms\").",
        "Try sending an MMS again and report the result."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Final check",
      "why": "If it still fails, a focused diagnostic helps pinpoint the remaining cause.",
      "actions": [
        "Run can_send_mms and share the output."
      ]
    }
