  "summary": "Thanks for the details. I located your account and enabled international data roaming on your line ending in 2002. Your line is Active on the Premium Plan (15 GB), with about 8.7 GB used this cycle, so you’re under your limit. Next, we’ll verify mobile data works in France and then confirm the MMS prerequisites on your phone.",
  "actions_taken_on_our_side": [
    "Enabled international roaming for your line 555-123-2002 so it can use data while you’re abroad."
  ],
  "what_i_checked": {
    "line_status": "Active",
    "roaming_on_account": "Enabled now",
    "plan": "Premium Plan • 15 GB/month • $2/GB refuel",
    "usage_this_cycle": "8.7 GB of 15 GB used (cycle ends 2025-02-28)"
  },
  "why_these_steps": [
    "MMS requires mobile data and a correct MMSC (part of APN). When you’re abroad, roaming must be enabled on both the account (done) and the phone.",
    "If mobile data is off, set to 2G/3G, or APN/MMSC is missing, MMS will fail.",
    "Wi‑Fi Calling can sometimes interfere with MMS; we’ll briefly disable it for testing if needed."
  ],
  "next_steps_for_you": [
    {
      "step": "Turn Wi‑Fi OFF and make sure Mobile Data is ON",
      "how": "Use check_network_status. If mobile data shows disabled, use toggle_data to enable."
    },
    {
      "step": "Enable Data Roaming on the phone",
      "how": "Use toggle_roaming to turn roaming ON."
    },
    {
      "step": "Refresh the cellular registration",
      "how": "Use toggle_airplane_mode to turn Airplane Mode ON for ~10 seconds, then OFF."
    },
    {
      "step": "Test mobile data",
      "how": "With Wi‑Fi off, try loading any website. Optionally run run_speed_test and share the result."
    },
    {
      "step": "Test MMS",
      "how": "Send a photo (MMS) to any contact and tell me what happens."
    },
    {
      "step": "If MMS still fails, optimize network mode",
      "how": "Use check_network_mode_preference. If it shows 2G/3G, use set_network_mode_preference to \"4g_5g_preferred\" and test MMS again."
    },
    {
      "step": "Verify APN/MMSC",
      "how": "Use check_apn_settings. If the MMSC is missing/incorrect, use reset_apn_settings and then reboot_device. After the reboot, test MMS again."
    },
    {
      "step": "Rule out Wi‑Fi Calling interference",
      "how": "Use check_wifi_calling_status. If ON, use toggle_wifi_calling to turn it OFF and test MMS again."
    },
    {
      "step": "Android only: confirm messaging app permissions",
      "how": "Use check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\"). If \"storage\" or \"sms\" isn’t granted, use grant_app_permission to allow them, then test MMS."
    }
  ],
  "please_do_now": [
    "Go through steps 1–5 in order.",
    "Tell me: did mobile data browsing work? did the MMS send? If anything fails, let me know which step and what you saw."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Is your phone iPhone (iOS) or Android? If you’re not sure, we can proceed without it.",
    "Do you currently have Wi‑Fi Calling ON?"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Since I’ve enabled roaming on your account, the most common remaining blocker is Data Roaming being OFF on the phone itself. Toggling Airplane Mode after enabling it helps the phone register on a partner network.",
    "If APN reset is needed, a reboot is required for changes to apply."
  ]
}

messages.content:
{
  "confirmation": "Yes—please turn Airplane Mode OFF first. That restores all radios so your phone can register on a partner network in France. Then we’ll verify mobile data and roaming on the phone, test web, and test MMS.",
  "why_this_order": [
    "With Airplane Mode ON, your phone cannot connect to any cellular network, so MMS and data cannot work.",
    "After we re-enable radios, we confirm mobile data and data roaming are ON on the phone (I already enabled roaming on your account side), then test."
  ],
  "step_by_step": [
    {
      "step": "Turn Airplane Mode OFF",
      "how": "Use toggle_airplane_mode to switch it OFF, then wait 30–60 seconds for signal bars/network type (4G/5G/LTE) to appear."
    },
    {
      "step": "Check mobile data and roaming on the phone",
      "how": "Use check_network_status. If Mobile Data is disabled, use toggle_data to turn it ON. Since you’re abroad, use toggle_roaming to turn Data Roaming ON."
    },
    {
      "step": "Quick refresh if needed",
      "how": "If you still see no signal after 60 seconds, toggle_airplane_mode ON for ~10 seconds and then OFF again."
    },
    {
      "step": "Test mobile data",
      "how": "With Wi‑Fi OFF, try loading any website. Optionally run run_speed_test and share the result."
    },
    {
      "step": "Test MMS",
      "how": "Send a photo (MMS) to any contact and let me know what happens."
    }
  ],
  "what_to_report_back": [
    "After turning Airplane Mode OFF: do you see signal bars and a network type (e.g., 4G/5G/LTE)?",
    "Does check_network_status show Mobile Data = ON and Roaming = ON?",
    "Were you able to browse the web on mobile data?",
    "Did the MMS send successfully or is there an error message?"
  ],
  "if_mms_still_fails_after_tests": [
    {
      "step": "Optimize network mode",
      "how": "Use check_network_mode_preference. If set to 2G/3G, use set_network_mode_preference to \"4g_5g_preferred\" and test again."
    },
    {
      "step": "Verify APN/MMSC",
      "how": "Use check_apn_settings. If MMSC is missing/incorrect, use reset_apn_settings and then reboot_device. Test MMS after reboot."
    },
    {
      "step": "Rule out Wi‑Fi Calling interference",
      "how": "Use check_wifi_calling_status. If ON, use toggle_wifi_calling to turn it OFF and test MMS again."
    }
  ],
  "reminders": [
    "I already enabled international roaming on your line ending in 2002; enabling Data Roaming on the phone itself is also required for data/MMS abroad.",
    "MMS requires mobile data; it won’t send over Wi‑Fi alone on many networks."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Please proceed with the steps above and share each result. If you prefer, I can walk you through them one by one.",
    "If problems persist, is your phone iPhone (iOS) or Android? That helps tailor the next checks."
  ]
}

