messages.content:
{
  "summary": "No signal + “SIM card missing” means your phone isn’t detecting the SIM, so MMS and data can’t work yet. We’ll first confirm the SIM status from the phone, reseat the SIM to restore detection, then re-check signal and enable data/roaming to test MMS.",
  "what_i_already_did_on_account": "International roaming is enabled on your line ending in 2002. Once the SIM is detected and the phone’s data/roaming are ON, data and MMS should work abroad.",
  "why_this_flow": [
    "MMS requires basic cellular service and mobile data. A missing SIM prevents any network registration.",
    "Policy: If SIM is Missing, reseat the SIM; if Locked (PIN/PUK), we must escalate to a human agent for SIM security."
  ],
  "immediate_steps_on_your_phone": [
    {
      "step": "Check SIM status",
      "action": "check_sim_status",
      "what_to_share_back": "Does it say Active, Missing, or Locked (PIN/PUK)?"
    },
    {
      "step": "If SIM shows Missing: reseat the SIM",
      "action": "reseat_sim_card",
      "how": [
        "If you have a physical SIM: power off, gently remove the tray, reinsert the SIM flush and oriented correctly, then power on.",
        "If you use eSIM: run the reseat_sim_card action (simulates a SIM refresh) and then proceed."
      ],
      "after": "Once back on, run check_sim_status again and tell me the result."
    },
    {
      "step": "If SIM shows Locked (PIN/PUK)",
      "action": "Do not guess the PIN/PUK",
      "next": "Tell me immediately. I’ll transfer you to a human agent to securely assist with SIM unlock per policy."
    },
    {
      "step": "If SIM shows Active but still no signal",
      "action": "Network refresh",
      "how": [
        "toggle_airplane_mode ON for ~10 seconds, then OFF",
        "Wait up to 60 seconds for bars and a network type (4G/5G/LTE) to appear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Enable data and roaming on the phone (once SIM is Active and you have some signal)",
      "actions": [
        "check_network_status",
        "If Mobile Data is disabled: toggle_data to turn it ON",
        "Since you’re abroad: toggle_roaming to turn Data Roaming ON"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Test mobile data and MMS",
      "actions": [
        "With Wi‑Fi OFF, open a website to confirm data works",
        "Optionally run run_speed_test and share result",
        "Send a photo (MMS) to any contact and tell me what happens"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "if_still_not_working_after_above": [
    {
      "step": "Optimize network mode",
      "actions": [
        "check_network_mode_preference",
        "If set to 2G/3G, use set_network_mode_preference to \"4g_5g_preferred\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Verify APN/MMSC",
      "actions": [
        "check_apn_settings",
        "If MMSC is missing/incorrect: reset_apn_settings, then reboot_device",
        "After reboot, test MMS again"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Rule out Wi‑Fi Calling interference",
      "actions": [
        "check_wifi_calling_status",
        "If ON, toggle_wifi_calling OFF and test MMS"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "questions_for_you_now": [
    "Please run check_sim_status and share the exact result (Active, Missing, or Locked).",
    "Are you using a physical SIM or an eSIM on this phone?",
    "Did you see any PIN/PUK prompt at any point?"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "If SIM remains Missing after reseat and a reboot, it can indicate a SIM/tray issue. We can try another refresh and visual check next.",
    "If Locked, I will transfer you to a human agent to securely handle SIM PIN/PUK as required by policy."
  ]
}

