messages.content:
{
  "summary": "Your line and data look good, SMS works, Wi‑Fi Calling is OFF, APN has an MMSC, and you’re on 5G. Since can_send_mms reports the app cannot send MMS, this points to an app-level permission/restriction or a device quirk with 5G. We’ll verify app permissions via a quick device check, ensure nothing is blocking the app, and test on 4G-only.",
  "steps_in_order": [
    {
      "step": "Check the messaging app’s permissions via the device check",
      "why": "Confirms whether the system actually granted SMS and Storage permissions the app needs for MMS.",
      "how": [
        "Run: check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\").",
        "Share the output. If it does NOT list both \"sms\" and \"storage\" as granted, do the next sub-step.",
        "If missing, run: grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"sms\") and grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"storage\").",
        "Then try sending one small photo MMS again (Wi‑Fi OFF, Mobile Data ON)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Check if the app is restricted in the background",
      "why": "If background data is restricted for the messaging app, MMS can fail silently.",
      "how": [
        "Run: check_app_status(app_name=\"messaging\").",
        "If it shows background data restricted/disabled, go to Settings > Apps > Messaging > Mobile data & Wi‑Fi (or Data usage) and enable Background data and Unrestricted data usage.",
        "Retry one MMS."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Temporarily force 4G/LTE only and test",
      "why": "On some devices, MMS may fail on certain 5G stacks. This isolates a 5G-specific issue.",
      "how": [
        "Run: set_network_mode_preference(mode=\"4g_only\").",
        "Keep Wi‑Fi OFF and Mobile Data ON, then send one small photo MMS.",
        "If it works, we can later set it back to 4g_5g_preferred."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "what_i_will_do_next_on_our_side": "While you run Step 1, in my next action I’ll double-check your device and plan records on our side to confirm there are no flags affecting MMS, then report back.",
  "questions": [
    "Please paste the result of check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\"). Does it show sms and storage as granted?",
    "What does check_app_status(app_name=\"messaging\") say about background data?",
    "After switching to 4g_only, were you able to send an MMS?"
  ],
  "if_still_fails": "If MMS still fails after these steps, we’ve exhausted all device-side fixes available here. I’ll escalate you to a human technical specialist to run deeper MMS tracing and advanced APN/MMSC validation."
}

