      "Locate the SIM tray: It’s a small slot on the phone’s edge with a tiny pinhole.",
      "Eject the tray: Insert a SIM tool or straightened paperclip into the pinhole until the tray pops out.",
      "Check the SIM: Note the angled corner; ensure the gold contacts are clean (gently wipe if needed).",
