    "After reseating or restart: do you see bars and a network label (5G/LTE/4G/3G)?",
    "Does example.com load with Wi‑Fi off and Mobile data on?",
    "Did the picture message send?"
  ],
  "thought_process": "Because your account and line are healthy, the lack of signal points to the device not registering on the network—often due to SIM detection. Checking SIM status and reseating the SIM is the most direct fix. If the SIM is Locked, I’ll transfer you to a human agent to provide the correct unlock code safely."
}

